    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akiŋarakin Ŋikristo ŋuluce",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ecaryono ayoŋ akigirakin iyes abaruwa ŋina etapit ŋainakineta ŋuna iyakiyanaryo lotuŋa ŋulu ka Akuj alo Yudeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayeni ayoŋ atemar itenito iyes akiŋarakin ka eketuror ayoŋ iyes alotuŋa a ŋulu a Makedonia. Abala ayoŋ ebe, “Ageun alokaru a ŋolo alunyar, etenito ŋikanupak ŋulu eya Akaia akiŋarakin.” Adau alelakinit kus ŋina ka akiŋaranakin akisimukekin ikes ŋulu alalak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tokona, eyakuunit ayoŋ ŋikaitotoi lu, ikotere nyeruwor akituro kosi aŋuna kus akoŋinait anakiro a ŋun. Nai, ikwapei alimunitor ayoŋ, itenito iyes akiŋarakin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani nai kikipotu isua ka ŋituŋa ŋulu a Makedonia, ido ikiryamun iyes pa itenito, ikirumete isua ŋileec--nyikilimuni nai ŋuna a ŋileec kus a ŋilopeyek--anerae ikikinyomitae sek isua iyes! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu ayoŋ otamu atemar ejok akiŋitakin ŋikaitotoi ŋul aberun neni kus eriŋa ayoŋ, ikotere kitemokis ŋainakineta ŋuna iikinito iyes alemun. Kitemokino nai erae ŋainakineta ŋuna icamito iyes ŋilopeyek alemun, meere ŋuna ikitiŋakinitae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toyenete nu: ituŋanan ŋini eekini ŋikinyom ŋulu ekudyoko, elemuni ŋidikudyo; ituŋanan ŋini eekini ŋikinyom ŋulu elalak, elemuni ŋulu elalak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itemokino nai ŋinituŋanan inak ikwapei etubunitor iŋes elope, meere ka alejeo kori ka akitiŋakinit, anerae emina Akuj ŋini einanakini ka alakara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epedori Akuj ainakin iyes alotyae a ŋolo alalan adepar etyae ŋolo iitanito iyes, ikotere nai toyakatar iyes jwi jwi ŋinibore daadaŋ iitanito ka kilapara daŋ aŋuna a etic a ŋolo ajokan a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwapei ebaakar Akigiret ebe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
